  "reviewer_note": "Arrival 1275 and departure 1292 are on EBSCO and World History Encyclopedia; the Mariners' Museum gives no arrival year. Waypoint year 1275.3 is a placement for spring. Shangdu coordinates are the Wikidata point for Xanadu (EBSCO names Shangdu as the summer capital; World History Encyclopedia places Xanadu in Inner Mongolia); GeoNames Shangdu Xian is a different modern county. World History Encyclopedia says doubts remain over what he saw, but most scholars believe he went to China. Venice appears at both ends of the path. Acre and Venice degrees-minutes-seconds converted to decimal.",
